        "show_warp_icon": true,
        "show_thread_accent": true,
        "paragraph_1": "Banaras weaving has faced real pressure from powerloom copies, rising costs of silk and zari, and a shrinking number of master weavers. Design collaborations and clear labelling have helped, and so have buyers who ask who wove the saree.",
